Rolling Loud was not ready for this Ms. Lauryn Hill delivered a standout performance of her 1998 classic “Lost Ones” at Rolling Loud Miami 2024. Backed by a full live arrangement, Hill performed the track with rapid-fire delivery and strong breath control, bringing the energy of the original recording to the festival stage.

